==Trivia==
*Chinchompas were inspired by the {{wp|chinchilla}}.
*Black chinchompas are referenced as the most explosive type of chinchompa in dialogue in the ''RuneScape 3'' quest [[rsw:Azzanadra's Quest|Azzanadra's Quest]], despite not existing in ''RuneScape 3'' at the time of the quest's release.
*If a Chinchompa begins to enter a [[Box trap]] on the final tick, it will delay the boxes collapse until the trap either succeeds, or fails.

